					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														I hate to respond to my own message, but I missed the most important<br />
thread of all until after I wrote this (The Overthere thread).  This type<br />
of infighting will kill a guild faster than anything, and I think that we<br />
need to think more about what messages we are trying to convey to<br />
each other before we type them into chat or on a board.  I will make<br />
no comments on the specific issues, I am not a leader, and was not <br />
privvy to the guild meeting where these issues were discussed, but<br />
I will say that I would have perferred for everyone one involved to <br />
have worked out their differences (or at least tried) before moving to<br />
a public forum to vent.						</td>
